WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.084 --> 00:00:00.805
- I'm Ben.

00:00:00.805 --> 00:00:01.478
- I'm Amanda.

00:00:01.478 --> 00:00:01.878
- I'm Jen.

00:00:01.878 --> 00:00:02.430
- I'm Chris.

00:00:02.430 --> 00:00:03.925
- [Everyone] And I believe in ghosts.

00:00:08.385 --> 00:00:09.219
- I have no real reason

00:00:09.219 --> 00:00:10.761
for actually believing in ghosts.

00:00:10.761 --> 00:00:12.473
I was raised Roman Catholic,

00:00:12.473 --> 00:00:13.849
so maybe it's a religious thing.

00:00:13.849 --> 00:00:16.392
- I believe that ghosts
could be out there.

00:00:16.392 --> 00:00:18.311
I haven't seen them personally,

00:00:18.311 --> 00:00:20.332
but I have definitely not counted them out

00:00:20.332 --> 00:00:21.700
of the realm of possibility.

00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:23.194
- I watched a lot of horror movies

00:00:23.194 --> 00:00:26.892
and was really gung-ho
on ghost and spirit life.

00:00:26.892 --> 00:00:29.157
- I'm friends with a
lot of spiritual people.

00:00:29.157 --> 00:00:31.573
They told me that I have
an affinity for spirits,

00:00:31.573 --> 00:00:35.353
and I'm hoping that that means
that I won't get possessed.

00:00:37.650 --> 00:00:38.456
Yes.

00:00:38.456 --> 00:00:40.552
- I have no idea what to expect tonight.

00:00:40.552 --> 00:00:42.772
- [Ben] The closer we get to
actually having to go there,

00:00:42.772 --> 00:00:46.477
the more I can feel my nerves
getting a little cranked up.

00:00:46.477 --> 00:00:47.882
- [Chris] What I'm hoping will happen is

00:00:47.882 --> 00:00:49.793
that there will probably be ghosts

00:00:49.793 --> 00:00:51.955
that try to communicate with us,

00:00:51.955 --> 00:00:53.680
but I don't think it's gonna be violent,

00:00:53.680 --> 00:00:54.922
like in horror movies.

00:00:54.922 --> 00:00:56.257
- [Amanda] The worst thing
that could happen tonight

00:00:56.257 --> 00:00:57.475
is someone getting possessed.

00:00:57.475 --> 00:00:59.387
- [Voiceover] Oh, (bleep).

00:00:59.397 --> 00:01:03.538
- [Amanda] I am immediately
regretting everything right now.

00:01:04.899 --> 00:01:06.728
- This seems like a stupid, (bleep) idea.

00:01:10.969 --> 00:01:12.560
- My name is Chad. I'm co-founder

00:01:12.560 --> 00:01:13.742
of Amadillo Paranormal.

00:01:14.602 --> 00:01:16.329
- I'm Josh. I'm the founder.

00:01:16.329 --> 00:01:18.872
- This is an asylum I had found before.

00:01:18.872 --> 00:01:20.989
It's been kind of locally known.

00:01:20.989 --> 00:01:24.240
- [Josh] There's no actual
evidence of this being an asylum

00:01:24.240 --> 00:01:29.122
It's all folklore. There's no
actual address to this place.

00:01:29.122 --> 00:01:30.675
There's no real roads here.

00:01:30.675 --> 00:01:32.325
- [Chad] Literally in the middle
of nowhere. - [Josh] Yeah.

00:01:32.335 --> 00:01:33.545
- [Chad] A couple things
that we've gotten here,

00:01:33.555 --> 00:01:35.158
we've gotten a lot of voices.

00:01:35.158 --> 00:01:38.599
Me and Daniel actually
heard a little boy laughing.

00:01:38.599 --> 00:01:40.810
- [Josh] We've gotten
EMF hits here confirming

00:01:40.810 --> 00:01:42.938
that there is some spirit
that either believes they're

00:01:42.938 --> 00:01:44.355
a nurse or was once a nurse.

00:01:51.180 --> 00:01:53.447
- [Chad] Let's go ahead and
get this started, you guys.

00:01:53.447 --> 00:01:54.532
Everything off.

00:01:54.532 --> 00:01:55.701
- [Voiceover] All lights.
- [Amanda] Oh, (bleep) me.

00:01:55.701 --> 00:01:56.951
(rubs hands together)

00:01:56.951 --> 00:01:58.681
- [Chad] Hey, is there
anybody here with us tonight?

00:02:01.116 --> 00:02:03.583
You've seen us earlier.
We have a smaller group.

00:02:03.583 --> 00:02:05.001
They actually believe in you.

00:02:06.361 --> 00:02:07.545
Do you feel it? It's all cold.

00:02:09.783 --> 00:02:11.299
So what it does is you'll hear this noise,

00:02:11.299 --> 00:02:13.474
and it'll cycle to the radio stations.

00:02:13.474 --> 00:02:14.886
We're out in the middle of nowhere.

00:02:14.886 --> 00:02:16.045
There's no radio stations out here.

00:02:16.045 --> 00:02:17.555
It's gonna be blank. If you hear a voice

00:02:17.555 --> 00:02:20.923
or anything come through,
most likely it's paranormal.

00:02:20.923 --> 00:02:22.728
(paranormal rapping)

00:02:22.728 --> 00:02:24.388
- [Chad] Is there anybody here tonight?

00:02:26.001 --> 00:02:27.180
Ah, did you see that?

00:02:28.483 --> 00:02:29.559
So that wasn't us.

00:02:30.925 --> 00:02:33.114
- [Josh] Are you speaking to
us from the back building?

00:02:33.114 --> 00:02:37.735
(paranormal rapping)

00:02:37.735 --> 00:02:38.535
- [Chad] What?

00:02:40.795 --> 00:02:42.715
- [Chad] Are you allowed to
come over here to this building?

00:02:42.715 --> 00:02:47.715
(paranormal rapping)

00:02:48.577 --> 00:02:49.988
- [Josh] How many of you are there?

00:02:49.988 --> 00:02:53.728
(paranormal rapping)

00:02:53.728 --> 00:02:54.341
- [Chad] There's another voice.

00:02:54.341 --> 00:02:55.469
- [Chris] I heard that.
- [Amanda] I hate this.

00:02:55.469 --> 00:02:56.720
(giggles)

00:02:56.720 --> 00:02:57.564
- [Chad] Are you guys ok?

00:02:57.564 --> 00:02:58.346
- [Amanda] Yeah.

00:03:00.166 --> 00:03:02.768
That is kind of eerie. Just like I said,

00:03:02.768 --> 00:03:04.102
keep your eyes open everywhere.

00:03:05.082 --> 00:03:07.921
And when you're ready,
everybody go ahead and go dark.

00:03:08.831 --> 00:03:10.091
(paranormal rapping}

00:03:10.091 --> 00:03:11.234
- [Amanda] Do you hear something?

00:03:11.234 --> 00:03:12.777
- [Chris] Yeah, I hear something, too.

00:03:13.467 --> 00:03:14.780
- [Voiceover] What? Behind you?

00:03:14.790 --> 00:03:17.740
- [Chris] Yeah. It just
sounds like crackling

00:03:17.740 --> 00:03:19.159
that's separate from that.

00:03:19.159 --> 00:03:20.160
- [Amanda] Yeah. I'm not sure

00:03:20.160 --> 00:03:21.994
if it's people moving around or something.

00:03:21.994 --> 00:03:24.080
- [Chad] Ok. Well, I mean
there's nobody behind you, so.

00:03:24.080 --> 00:03:25.039
- [Amanda] Oh, cool.

00:03:25.039 --> 00:03:26.541
- [Chad] You're the last line of defense.

00:03:27.441 --> 00:03:28.828
Are you still here with us?

00:03:28.828 --> 00:03:33.828
(paranormal rapping)

00:03:33.848 --> 00:03:36.514
- [Daniel] (mumbles)
something right out there.

00:03:36.884 --> 00:03:38.007
- [Chad] What?

00:03:38.007 --> 00:03:39.887
- [Ben] Something ran across out there.

00:03:39.887 --> 00:03:40.638
- [Chad] Out where?

00:03:40.638 --> 00:03:45.435
- [Daniel] Out in the distance,
where this building ends

00:03:45.435 --> 00:03:47.907
- [Chad] (mumbles) behind us right now.
- [Daniel] Right there.

00:03:47.907 --> 00:03:49.314
- [Amanda] I think we're good.
- [Chris] I think we're good.

00:03:49.314 --> 00:03:51.341
- [Amanda] I think we're good.
- [Voiceover] We're good.

00:03:55.111 --> 00:03:56.363
Ghost hunting was exhillerating.

00:03:56.363 --> 00:03:57.865
I thought it was a lot of fun.

00:03:57.865 --> 00:04:00.255
- I was disappointed.

00:04:00.255 --> 00:04:02.430
- Not much happened as I expected it to,

00:04:02.430 --> 00:04:04.912
but I still felt like
there was something there.

00:04:04.912 --> 00:04:06.544
- Through the course of the night,

00:04:06.544 --> 00:04:08.750
I felt like I went and faced this fear

00:04:08.750 --> 00:04:10.298
that was probably rooted in a lot

00:04:10.298 --> 00:04:13.294
of irrational, imagionary thinking.

00:04:13.294 --> 00:04:15.509
- I was terrified the entire time.

00:04:15.509 --> 00:04:17.800
I came out of it very nauseous, actually.

00:04:17.800 --> 00:04:19.260
- I still believe that supernatural things

00:04:19.260 --> 00:04:20.637
can occur out there.

00:04:20.637 --> 00:04:22.597
- I definitely still
think that ghosts exist,

00:04:22.597 --> 00:04:25.016
that paranormal activity
exists, places are haunted.

00:04:25.016 --> 00:04:26.684
- I still believe that there are things

00:04:26.684 --> 00:04:28.269
that we can't see that interact with us.

00:04:28.269 --> 00:04:29.377
And there are people that say

00:04:29.377 --> 00:04:32.148
that they want real,
concrete evidence for it,

00:04:32.148 --> 00:04:35.443
but that's not how the spiritual
world is supposed to work.

00:04:35.443 --> 00:04:36.771
- Just because you didn't see anything,

00:04:36.771 --> 00:04:38.405
doesn't mean that there
wasn't anything there.

00:04:38.405 --> 00:04:39.731
- I ain't afraid of no

00:04:39.731 --> 00:04:41.032
(loud shrieking)

00:04:41.866 --> 00:04:43.265
- [Chad] Keep your mind
open. Keep your ears open.

00:04:43.265 --> 00:04:45.782
Sometimes you'll feel a
slight touch, a breath.

00:04:45.782 --> 00:04:47.411
- [Bearded Man] Is it just
me, or does everyone now feel

00:04:47.413 --> 00:04:49.499
like they're feeling breaths and touches?

00:04:51.128 --> 00:04:52.533
- It's just so sad

00:04:52.533 --> 00:04:53.758
what's happening over there.

00:04:53.758 --> 00:04:55.110
- Oh, yeah.

00:04:57.834 --> 00:04:59.217
You don't know the half of it.

00:04:59.237 --> 00:05:01.787
(elevator music)

